<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7651"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 12:28 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here are pictures of the envelope and the postcard inside, sent eo Kansas Fox yesterday: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kwch.com/servlet/Satellite?pagename=KWCH/MGArticle/WCH_BasicArticle&amp;c=MGArticle&amp;cid=1031780871070&amp;path=" target=_top>http://www.kwch.com/servlet/Satellite?pagename=KWC H/MGArticle/WCH_BasicArticle&amp;c=MGArticle&amp;cid=10317 80871070&amp;path=</a>  <BR>   <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
