<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7681"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Maxgravis<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Maxgravis<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 7:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I just noticed something too, it said number 8 was the second cereal box, so number 7 had to have been a cereal box too. On another note, I just rented the movie &#34;Saw&#34;, it is weird, I wonder how much BTK likes movies about serial killers? The guy in Saw had a brain tumor. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
