</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Catcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 8:17 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Nice work Ron!  Do you mind if we replicate your synopsis at  <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/10/508.html?1108655567" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/10/508.htm l?1108655567</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
