</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 9:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->you know the puzzle everyone was working on the one that Skov figured out the three parts, the MO the Id and the Ruse can anyone tell me what #letter that was. Because if you lay it out in the chapters of the BTK story he retitled It would be #8<!--/Text--></td></tr>
