<!--Post: 7712--><!--Time: 1108663057-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7712"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Surfietx<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Surfietx<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 9:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Per ChiefRon from another thread: <BR> <BR>1&#41; Wichita Eagle receives Wegerle License.  <BR>2&#41; KAKE receives chapter list.  <BR>3&#41; WPD receives OTERO letter  <BR>4&#41; Letter discovered at library  <BR>5&#41; UPS drop  <BR>6&#41; Murdock Park  <BR>7&#41; Presumably 1st Cereal Box  <BR>8&#41; 2nd Cereal Box  <BR>9&#41; Post card to KAKE asking about 7 and 8  <BR>10&#41; Happ Kakemann post card to KAKE  <BR>11&#41; Letter to KSAS  <BR> <BR>That would be drop 4 or 5..I&#39;m not sure<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7712-->
